  "summary_text": "Northwind Teams launch\nLaunch readiness: all green except load testing\nMargin question and doc and headcount ask\nMargin question is kind of stuck\nConcern with doc: that we end up rebuilding it\nDoc is the blocker\nHeadcount ask is kind of stuck\nHeadcount ask is not where i'd want it\nPreference to get more data rather than check with legal\nPriority list and open questions and timeline\nSuggestion to do a proper write-up before touching priority list\nOpen questions is a nice to have\nOpen questions is basically done\nSuggestion to revisit it next cycle before touching timeline\nPreference to do it properly rather than map out the edge cases\nInvestor update and edge cases and budget\nInvestor update is pretty solid\nEdge cases is a known issue\nReal issue may be operating cadence rather than budget\nProgress updates\nDone: fix SSO session token expiry (Sam)",
  "summary_markdown": "### Northwind Teams launch\n- Launch readiness: all green except load testing\n\n### Margin question and doc and headcount ask\n- Margin question is kind of stuck\n- Concern with doc: that we end up rebuilding it\n  - Doc is the blocker\n- Headcount ask is kind of stuck\n  - Headcount ask is not where i'd want it\n- Preference to get more data rather than check with legal\n\n### Priority list and open questions and timeline\n- Suggestion to do a proper write-up before touching priority list\n- Open questions is a nice to have\n  - Open questions is basically done\n- Suggestion to revisit it next cycle before touching timeline\n- Preference to do it properly rather than map out the edge cases\n\n### Investor update and edge cases and budget\n- Investor update is pretty solid\n- Edge cases is a known issue\n- Real issue may be operating cadence rather than budget\n\n### Progress updates\n- **Done:** fix SSO session token expiry (Sam)",
